Package: libfprint-elan-0c6e-fix
Version: 1.0.0-1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Sikander Khan <skhan1903@outlook.com>
Depends: libfprint-2-2 (= 1:1.95.1+tod1-0ubuntu1.1), libfprint-2-tod1 (= 1:1.95.1+tod1-0ubuntu1.1), udev
Description: runtime power workaround for ELAN 04f3:0c6e
 Keeps USB runtime power management disabled for the ELAN 04f3:0c6e
 fingerprint reader. This prevents the reader from disconnecting during
 enrollment and verification on the ASUS M7600QE.
